---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
interface Props { lang?: 'en' | 'vi' }
const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const L = (en: string, vi: string) => (lang === 'vi' ? vi : en);
const W = 900;
const H = 326;
---
<figure class="dps">
  <div class="dps-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label={L("Five causes of process pauses: stop-the-world garbage collection, VM live migration or CPU steal, slow synchronous disk I/O, OS paging, and SIGSTOP. All lead to the same result: a thread frozen for an arbitrary time at any line.", "Năm nguyên nhân khiến tiến trình khựng: GC stop-the-world, chuyển VM hoặc CPU steal, I/O đĩa đồng bộ chậm, swap và SIGSTOP. Tất cả dẫn tới cùng kết quả: luồng đóng băng một thời gian bất kỳ ở dòng nào.")}>
<text x="20" y="24" class="t-h">{L("Many different causes, one effect: your thread stops without knowing","Nhiều nguyên nhân khác nhau, một hậu quả: luồng dừng mà không hay biết")}</text>
<rect x="20" y="50" width="360" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="hourglass" x={46} y={72} size={26} />
<text x="72" y="77" class="t-b">{L("Stop-the-world GC","GC dừng toàn bộ (stop-the-world)")}</text>
<path d="M 380 72 L 448.3 159.3" class="ln" /><polygon points="452,164 444.8,160.5 450.3,156.2" class="hd" />
<rect x="20" y="104" width="360" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="cloud" x={46} y={126} size={26} />
<text x="72" y="131" class="t-b">{L("VM live migration, CPU steal","Chuyển VM trực tiếp, CPU steal")}</text>
<path d="M 380 126 L 446.7 161.2" class="ln" /><polygon points="452,164 444.0,163.7 447.3,157.6" class="hd" />
<rect x="20" y="158" width="360" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="disk" x={46} y={180} size={26} />
<text x="72" y="185" class="t-b">{L("Slow synchronous disk I/O","I/O đĩa đồng bộ chậm")}</text>
<path d="M 380 180 L 446.1 165.3" class="ln" /><polygon points="452,164 445.7,169.0 444.2,162.2" class="hd" />
<rect x="20" y="212" width="360" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="disk" x={46} y={234} size={26} />
<text x="72" y="239" class="t-b">{L("OS paging under memory pressure","Swap khi thiếu RAM")}</text>
<path d="M 380 234 L 447.7 168.2" class="ln" /><polygon points="452,164 449.3,171.5 444.4,166.5" class="hd" />
<rect x="20" y="266" width="360" height="44" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="warning" x={46} y={288} size={26} />
<text x="72" y="293" class="t-b">{L("SIGSTOP (Ctrl-Z in a shell)","SIGSTOP (Ctrl-Z trong shell)")}</text>
<path d="M 380 288 L 449.0 169.2" class="ln" /><polygon points="452,164 451.4,172.0 445.4,168.5" class="hd" />
<rect x="458" y="106" width="422" height="116" rx="6" class="box-r" />
<DiagramIcon name="hourglass" x={490} y={164} size={32} />
<text x="522" y="152" class="t-r">{L("One thread, frozen","Một luồng bị đóng băng")}</text>
<text x="522" y="172" class="t-m">{L("for an arbitrary time, at any line,","trong thời gian bất kỳ, ở dòng nào,")}</text>
<text x="522" y="190" class="t-m">{L("and it cannot tell it was asleep.","mà nó không biết mình đã ngủ.")}</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>{L("The table below lists each cause and how teams reduce it. None of them can be ruled out.", "Bảng dưới liệt kê từng nguyên nhân và cách giảm nhẹ. Không nguyên nhân nào loại bỏ hẳn được.")}</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dps { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dps-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dps svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dps text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .dps .t-h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dps .t-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dps .t-r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .dps .t-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .dps .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dps .box-r { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dps .box-g { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dps .box-d { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .dps .box-gd { fill: transparent; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .dps .ln { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dps .ln-r { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dps .ln-g { fill: none; stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dps .ln-d { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dps .ln-rd { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .dps .ln-gr { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 2 4; }
  .dps .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dps .hd-r { fill: var(--red); }
  .dps .hd-g { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .dps .dot-g { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .dps figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
